@startuml webSocket-chat-flow
title WebSocket Chat Flow

actor Client as "Client\n(觀眾端／主播端)"
participant Server
database "chat_messages\n(DB)" as DB
participant RoomClients as "房間內所有 Clients\n(觀眾端／主播端)"

== 發送聊天訊息 ==

Client -> Server : socket.emit("sendMessage", message)

Server -> DB : 儲存 message 至 chat_messages

== 接收聊天訊息 ==

Server -> RoomClients : socket.emit("newMessage", savedMessage)
note right of Server : 廣播新訊息給所有房間內用戶（含自己）

@enduml
